- <i>Gilligan is actually Freb.</i>

505
00:38:36,047 --> 00:38:38,811
- Freb can order pizzas like nobody's business.
- What?

506
00:38:38,883 --> 00:38:42,512
- <i>It's true.</i>
- Hey, people gotta eat, right?

507
00:38:44,388 --> 00:38:47,687
This is outrageous.
I want my lawyer.

508
00:38:47,758 --> 00:38:50,784
I'm not saying a word
till I get a lawyer.

509
00:38:50,861 --> 00:38:53,295
All right, James,
that's an option.

510
00:38:53,364 --> 00:38:55,730
