- We kept it anonymous.

518
00:39:20,591 --> 00:39:26,427
He was a well-built kid.
Uh, looks like a boxer.

519
00:39:26,497 --> 00:39:30,092
- What do you want me to do?
- When he comes back, you call us.

520
00:39:30,167 --> 00:39:33,898
