- A hunch.

521
00:39:34,038 --> 00:39:37,530
To make the Friday 8:00 a.m. Deadline,
you're gonna have to go old school.

522
00:39:37,608 --> 00:39:41,942
A one-night boost.
Put all your nuts in one basket, okay?

523
00:39:42,012 --> 00:39:44,640
- One night? What, are you crazy?
- <i>Yes. No, I'm not crazy.</i>

524
00:39:44,715 --> 00:39:47,149
