it's a surprise attack.

531
00:40:07,538 --> 00:40:11,975
This is a complicated list,
fellas, it really is, okay?

532
00:40:12,042 --> 00:40:14,670
<i>There are 25</i>
<i>that aren't a problem,</i>

533
00:40:14,745 --> 00:40:16,906
