534
00:40:16,981 --> 00:40:19,745
And the new Mercedes,
they require laser-cut keys, okay?

535
00:40:19,817 --> 00:40:23,184
- Yeah, I got that covered.
- You have that covered?

536
00:40:23,254 --> 00:40:25,518
- What'd I just say? Yeah, I got it covered.
- Yeah.

537
00:40:25,589 --> 00:40:28,183
All right, all right.
Well, then let's get to work.

538
00:40:28,259 --> 00:40:30,420
<i>Toby, hack into</i>
<i>the insurance database...</i>

539
00:40:30,494 --> 00:40:32,428
