<i>as you can.</i>

540
00:40:32,496 --> 00:40:36,626
<i>Yes! I got addresses</i>
<i>on Hillary, Natalie and Tracy.</i>

541
00:40:36,700 --> 00:40:40,192
<i>Donny, check the D.M.V.For</i>
<i>the remaining cars on the list.</i>

542
00:40:40,271 --> 00:40:42,535
<i>I'm sorry, miss, but you've</i>
<i>missed five questions.</i>

543
00:40:42,606 --> 00:40:45,632
- <i>That's a failing.</i>
- No!

544
00:40:45,709 --> 00:40:48,075
- <i>Next.</i>
- No! Why?

545
00:40:48,145 --> 00:40:51,171
You're supposed to go faster
