Thanks a lot.

552
00:41:07,064 --> 00:41:11,125
My name's Roger, sir.
May I be of some help?

553
00:41:13,204 --> 00:41:16,605
That's funny, my name's Roger.
Two Rogers don't make a right.

554
00:41:16,674 --> 00:41:19,609
