571
00:42:07,458 --> 00:42:09,392
Superb.

572
00:42:09,460 --> 00:42:11,553
What else do you have
in the warehouse?

573
00:42:11,695 --> 00:42:15,153
<i>Mm-hmm. All right.</i>
<i>Uh-huh.</i>

574
