<i>in these containers.</i>

584
00:42:56,173 --> 00:42:59,404
Fellas, this is Sway.

585
00:42:59,476 --> 00:43:02,001
No questions.
I'm here for Kip.

586
00:43:02,079 --> 00:43:04,172
- All right.
- <i>All right.</i>

587
00:43:20,397 --> 00:43:22,831
- It's me. He's here.
