- Mm-hmm.

593
00:43:39,183 --> 00:43:41,413
Thank you.

594
00:43:52,563 --> 00:43:57,796
<i>Huh, Randall Raines,</i>
<i>Donny Astricky, Otto Halliwell.</i>

595
00:43:57,868 --> 00:43:59,961
