be waiting for you.

602
00:44:24,061 --> 00:44:26,154
Why do you call 'em
girls' names?

603
00:44:26,230 --> 00:44:29,358
That's a good question.
Why <i>do</i> you call 'em girls' names?

604
00:44:29,433 --> 00:44:34,029
<i>It's code. You say Jane,</i>
<i>you say Shirley, Lucy, Edna,</i>

605
00:44:34,104 --> 00:44:37,767
