<i>Wait. Wasn't Robin that</i>
<i>faggoty guy who hung with him?</i>

626
00:45:45,542 --> 00:45:48,067
No, that was Higgins.
That was Higgins.

627
00:45:48,145 --> 00:45:50,170
Hey, hey, ten points
for our fearless leader.

628
00:45:50,247 --> 00:45:53,239
<i>Sway, how 'bout giving us the honor</i>
