642
00:46:59,349 --> 00:47:02,580
<i>He's pulling something</i>
<i>out of his pocket. You see that?</i>

643
00:47:02,653 --> 00:47:05,679
<i>It's a camera. Looks like</i>
<i>he's just doing some homework.</i>

644
00:47:05,756 --> 00:47:07,849
<i>All right,</i>
<i>let's leave him be.</i>

645
00:47:07,925 --> 00:47:10,723
