650
00:47:24,675 --> 00:47:28,202
The '67 Shelby Mustang GT-500.

651
00:47:28,278 --> 00:47:31,770
- The GT-500?
- Yeah, yeah.

652
00:47:35,285 --> 00:47:38,152
