657
00:47:53,003 --> 00:47:56,871
<i>It's the one car, no matter how many times
you try to boost, something always happens.</i>

658
00:48:00,777 --> 00:48:05,373
We're gonna get through this this time,
right? It's gonna be smooth...

659
00:48:05,449 --> 00:48:07,644
- What's he doing?
- <i>And easy.</i>

660
00:48:07,718 --> 00:48:11,449
He's talkin' to her, man.
Tryin' to get reacquainted.

661
00:48:11,521 --> 00:48:15,321
<i>Done had a rough history. She almost</i>
<i>got him killed a couple of times.</i>

662
00:48:15,392 --> 00:48:18,122
- I don't want any talking back.
- <i>He flipped one on the Harbor freeway.</i>

663
00:48:18,195 --> 00:48:20,425
He went off
